{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "```python\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the nth Newman-Conway number using memoization.\n    It stores computed values as a function attribute `_memo`.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not hasattr(sequence, '_memo'):\n        sequence._memo = {1: 1, 2: 1}\n\n    if n in sequence._memo:\n        return sequence._memo[n]\n\n    # Calculate P(n-1) first\n    p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n\n    # Apply the formula: P(n) = P(P(n - 1)) + P(n - P(n - 1))\n    p_p_n_minus_1 = sequence(p_n_minus_1)\n    p_n_minus_p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n\n    result = p_p_n_minus_1 + p_n_minus_p_n_minus_1\n    sequence._memo[n] = result\n    return result\n```\n"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "```python\n_newman_conway_memo = [0, 1, 1]  # Memoization cache: P(0) unused, P(1)=1, P(2)=1.\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\\\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence using memoization.\n    P(1) = 1, P(2) = 1, P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1)) for n > 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    while len(_newman_conway_memo) <= n:\n        i = len(_newman_conway_memo)\n        p_i_minus_1 = _newman_conway_memo[i - 1]\n\n        # P(i) = P(P(i-1)) + P(i-P(i-1))\n        value = _newman_conway_memo[p_i_minus_1] + _newman_conway_memo[i - p_i_minus_1]\n        _newman_conway_memo.append(value)\n\n    return _newman_conway_memo[n]\n```"}
