{"task_id": "Mbpp/131", "solution": "```python\ndef reverse_vowels(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Reverses only the vowels in a given string, preserving non-vowel positions.\n    Vowels are defined as 'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u' (case-insensitive); 'y' is not a vowel.\n    \"\"\"\n    vowels_set = {'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u'}\n    char_list = list(s)\n\n    found_vowels = []\n    vowel_indices = []\n\n    for i, char in enumerate(char_list):\n        if char.lower() in vowels_set:\n            found_vowels.append(char)\n            vowel_indices.append(i)\n\n    found_vowels.reverse()\n\n    vowel_ptr = 0\n    for idx in vowel_indices:\n        char_list[idx] = found_vowels[vowel_ptr]\n        vowel_ptr += 1\n\n    return \"\".join(char_list)\n```"}
