{"task_id": "Mbpp/160", "solution": "```python\ndef find_solution(a, b, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds integers x and y that satisfy ax + by = n.\n    Returns (x, y) if a solution exists, otherwise returns None.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def extended_gcd(a_val, b_val):\n        \"\"\"\n        Helper function to implement the Extended Euclidean Algorithm.\n        Returns (x, y, gcd_val) such that a_val*x + b_val*y = gcd_val.\n        \"\"\"\n        if a_val == 0:\n            return (0, 1, b_val)\n        x1, y1, gcd_val = extended_gcd(b_val % a_val, a_val)\n        x = y1 - (b_val // a_val) * x1\n        y = x1\n        return (x, y, gcd_val)\n\n    x_prime, y_prime, gcd_val = extended_gcd(a, b)\n\n    if n % gcd_val != 0:\n        return None  # No solution exists if n is not divisible by gcd(a, b)\n\n    # Scale the particular solution to find x and y for ax + by = n\n    k = n // gcd_val\n    x = x_prime * k\n    y = y_prime * k\n    return (x, y)\n```\n"}
