{"task_id": "Mbpp/301", "solution": "```python\ndef dict_depth(input_dict: dict) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the maximum depth of nested dictionaries.\n    A dictionary with no nested dictionaries has a depth of 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_depth = 1\n    for value in input_dict.values():\n        if isinstance(value, dict):\n            # Recursively calculate depth of nested dictionary and add 1 for current level.\n            max_depth = max(max_depth, 1 + dict_depth(value))\n    return max_depth\n```"}
