{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of a number.\n    Returns 0 for numbers less than or equal to 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return 0\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate up to the square root to find factors efficiently.\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += i\n\n            j = number // i\n            if j != i and j % 2 == 0:\n                total_sum += j\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
