{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of the input number.\n    Returns the sum of all even factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    even_factors_sum = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= number:\n        if number % i == 0:\n            # If 'i' is a factor, check if it's even and add it.\n            if i % 2 == 0:\n                even_factors_sum += i\n\n            # Calculate the other factor 'j = number // i'.\n            # If 'j' is different from 'i', check if it's even and add it.\n            if (number // i) != i:\n                if (number // i) % 2 == 0:\n                    even_factors_sum += (number // i)\n        i += 1\n    return even_factors_sum\n```"}
