{"task_id": "Mbpp/463", "solution": "```python\ndef max_subarray_product(arr):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum product of a contiguous subarray within the given array.\n    Handles positive, negative numbers, and zeros correctly.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_so_far = arr[0]\n    current_max = arr[0]\n    current_min = arr[0]\n\n    for num in arr[1:]:\n        # If the current number is negative, swap current_max and current_min\n        # to correctly track maximum positive and negative products.\n        if num < 0:\n            current_max, current_min = current_min, current_max\n\n        # Update the maximum product ending at the current position.\n        current_max = max(num, current_max * num)\n        # Update the minimum product ending at the current position.\n        current_min = min(num, current_min * num)\n\n        # Update the overall maximum product found so far.\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    return max_so_far\n```"}
