{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "```python\ndef _calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    Uses the formula n * (n + 1) / 2.\n    \"\"\"\n    return (n * (n + 1)) // 2\n\ndef _calculate_sum_of_cubes_of_natural_numbers(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Uses the formula (sum of n natural numbers)^2.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_n = _calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(n)\n    return sum_n ** 2\n\ndef difference(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of the cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers.\n    The caller is trusted to provide a positive integer for n.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_cubes = _calculate_sum_of_cubes_of_natural_numbers(n)\n    sum_natural = _calculate_sum_of_natural_numbers(n)\n    result = sum_cubes - sum_natural\n    return result\n```\n"}
