{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the product of consecutive binomial coefficients for a given n.\n    It computes C(n, k) * C(n, k+1) for k from 0 to n-1 and sums these products.\n    \"\"\"\n    coefficients_list = []\n    for k_val in range(n + 1):\n        coefficients_list.append(math.comb(n, k_val))\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k_val in range(n):\n        product = coefficients_list[k_val] * coefficients_list[k_val + 1]\n        total_sum += product\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
