{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients C(n, k) * C(n, k+1).\n    The function iterates k from 0 to n-1.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n):\n        coeff1 = math.comb(n, k)\n        coeff2 = math.comb(n, k + 1)\n        product = coeff1 * coeff2\n        total_sum += product\n    return total_sum\n```"}
