{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "```python\ndef reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr: list, k: int) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the prefix of a list `arr` from index 0 up to `k` (exclusive), in-place.\n    This function modifies the input list directly using a two-pointer approach.\"\"\"\n\n    left = 0\n    right = k - 1\n\n    # Use a two-pointer approach to swap elements from both ends of the segment\n    while left < right:\n        arr[left], arr[right] = arr[right], arr[left]\n        left += 1\n        right -= 1\n```"}
