{"task_id": "Mbpp/724", "solution": "```python\ndef power_base_sum(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all digits of a base raised to a specified power.\n    Uses helper functions for exponentiation and digit summing.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _calculate_power(b: int, p: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Performs the exponentiation of base to power.\"\"\"\n        return b ** p\n\n    def _sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Sums the individual digits of a given number.\"\"\"\n        total = 0\n        for digit_char in str(number):\n            total += int(digit_char)\n        return total\n\n    calculated_value = _calculate_power(base, power)\n    sum_of_digits = _sum_digits(calculated_value)\n    return sum_of_digits\n```"}
