{"task_id": "Mbpp/775", "solution": "```python\ndef _is_odd_number(num: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given integer is an odd number.\n    Returns True if the number is odd, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    return num % 2 != 0\n\ndef _is_odd_index(index: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a given integer index is odd.\n    Returns True if the index is odd, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    return index % 2 != 0\n\ndef odd_position(numbers: list[int]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Determines if every element at an odd index in a list is an odd number.\n    Returns True if all conditions are met, False otherwise.\"\"\"\n    for index, value in enumerate(numbers):\n        if _is_odd_index(index):\n            if not _is_odd_number(value):\n                return False\n    return True\n```"}
